==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Relic Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Relic Doge Base]].
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Bore Jr.]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*8 [[Haniwanwan]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*15 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 44.67 seconds<sup>1,340f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*6 [[Bore Jr.|Bore Jrs]] spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Bore Jr.]] spawns as the boss after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Mr. Mer]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Mr. Mer]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Mr. Mer]] spawns after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Relic Doge Base here basically does nothing since you don't want to be fighting too close to the base anyways. Spamming Wave Immune units like Talented [[Dancer Cat]], [[Hitman Cat]], and [[Storm Beast Naala]] should win this stage pretty easily.

Alternatively, you can use Talented [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and rush the entire stage from the sizable amount of money dropped by the starting Celeboodle.

==Trivia==
*Like all [[Bazaar of the Pirate King]] stages, Stylist Mononoke is named after a movie, in this case ''[[:wikipedia:Princess Mononoke|Princess Mononoke]]''.
*Prior to [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]], the stage width was set to 5,000. The change was made because of a bug in how [[:Category:Animated Enemy Bases|Animated Bases]] spawn when not set as bosses.

